  "overview": "**Det Fælles Designsystem** is a light-first design system anchored on `#FFFFFF` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.7:1 contrast) and `#0059B3` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `IBM Plex Sans` (45px display down to 10px body), unified by `8px` base corner radius and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nMaintained by **Denmark**. Source: live stylesheet extraction (https://designsystem.dk/). Inventory: **15** colors, **21** typography steps, and **29** documented components (all rights reserved license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 29 component tokens with documented paddings: `0`, `1.6rem`, `16px`, `1px`, `1.6rem 1.6rem 1.6rem 5.6rem`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#F5F5F5` cards; separate sibling sections using `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`0 8px 24px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.2)`) paired with `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#0059B3` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#FFFFFF` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#0059B3` with `#f7f7f8` text (6.4:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `IBM Plex Sans` headings with `IBM Plex Sans` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `8px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (8px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#F5F5F5` surface shifts and `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `8px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `input` fields and secondary buttons."
}
